    "slug": "geth-destroyer",
    "details": {
      "level": {
        "value": 9
      },
      "publicNotes": "<p>The Geth Destroyer is a large, heavily armed geth infantry platform standing approximately eleven feet tall with dark grey armor and a bright blue optical sensor. It is equipped with a Geth Pulse Shotgun and strong shielding.</p><p>It will attempt to flank enemies before closing for powerful melee attacks. Despite not using cover as frequently as other geth units, its resilience and offensive power make it a serious threat at close range.</p>",
